  "releaseNotes": "v0.18.0: BREAKING — public namespaces renamed to include the .Core segment (FieldCure.AssistStudio.{Helpers,Models,Tools} → FieldCure.AssistStudio.Core.{Helpers,Models,Tools}). External consumers must update using statements; see RELEASENOTES.Core.md for a migration script. Adds invoke_tool dispatcher (lets Claude-class models reach external MCP tools without delegate_task), Gemini thoughtSignature round-trip via ToolCall.ProviderSignature, gpt-5+ reasoning-model recognition, and judgment specialist hardening (ExpectedFirstHeading / ForbiddenTrailingHeadings, per-specialist constants). XML docs added across Helpers.",
